      "worker"
     ],
     "cc": [],
     "subject": "Re: HB 1214 fiscal note",
     "body": "Received, thanks. Quick question: why isn't there any cost in FY2027? The bill passes in the 2027 session. Tom",
     "attachments": [],
     "meta": {}
    },
    {
     "id": "t4-ofm.w2",
     "at": "D4 16:50",
     "author": "worker",
     "to": [
      "c_ofm"
     ],
     "cc": [],
     "subject": null,
     "body": "Tom, the bill's effective date is July 1, 2027 (section 4), which is the first day of FY2028, and DWT has no obligations under it before then; procurement and hiring start on the effective date. So no FY2027 costs. If the Legislature adds an emergency clause or an earlier date, we'd need about $480,000 earlier for implementation.",
     "attachments": [],
     "meta": {}
    }
   ]
  },
